units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
variable a equal 3.52
lattice fcc ${a}
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 58.6934
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * /home/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt2.potential Ni
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 0.001
velocity all create 600.0 12345 dist gaussian mom yes rot yes
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp press pe ke etotal vol lx ly lz
thermo_modify flush yes
fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 2500.0 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1.0
run 10
